        </div>
        <div class="year-panels">
          <div class="year-panel active" id="year-1" role="tabpanel"><p class="year-caption">The beginning — when we had no idea we'd become inseparable.</p><div class="year-photos"><figure><div class="gallery-photo photo-filled"><img src="assets/photos/year-01-photo-01.png" alt="A first photo of us together" /></div><figcaption>one of our first few pics</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="gallery-photo photo-filled"><img src="assets/photos/year-01-photo-02.png" alt="Wearing the bunny hairband" /></div><figcaption>the second week you dobbesood my bunny hairband</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="gallery-photo photo-filled"><img src="assets/photos/year-01-photo-03.png" alt="A photo with Tanmayee" /></div><figcaption>picture with our most temporary third wheel...thanks ra Tanmayee :)</figcaption></figure></div></div>
          <div class="year-panel" id="year-2" role="tabpanel"><p class="year-caption">Year two — more adventures, more stories, more us.</p><div class="year-photos year-two-photos"><figure><div class="gallery-photo photo-filled"><img src="assets/photos/year-02-photo-01.jpeg" alt="A colourful Holi celebration together" /></div><figcaption>our most beautifool holi</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="gallery-photo photo-filled"><img src="assets/photos/year-02-photo-02.jpeg" alt="Our first sleepover together" /></div><figcaption>first sleepover&lt;3333</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="gallery-photo photo-filled"><img src="assets/photos/year-02-photo-03.jpeg" alt="Laughing together" /></div><figcaption>don't ask me why we were laughing</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="gallery-photo photo-filled"><img src="assets/photos/year-02-photo-04.jpeg" alt="Matching Ganesh Chaturthi outfits" /></div><figcaption>matching ganesh chaturthi outfits lol</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="gallery-photo photo-filled"><img src="assets/photos/year-02-photo-05.jpeg" alt="A make-up night" /></div><figcaption>make-up nighttt</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="gallery-photo photo-filled"><img src="assets/photos/year-02-photo-06.jpeg" alt="Helping clean the bathroom at midnight" /></div><figcaption>bathroom cleaner akka...midnight helpp</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="gallery-photo photo-filled"><img src="assets/photos/year-02-photo-07.jpeg" alt="A scooty ride together" /></div><figcaption>Scooty rides anydayyy</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="gallery-photo photo-filled"><img src="assets/photos/year-02-photo-08.jpeg" alt="A silhouette photo in the garden" /></div><figcaption>remember our fav garden where we ate hakka noodless?</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="gallery-photo photo-filled"><img src="assets/photos/year-02-photo-09.jpeg" alt="A smiling photo together" /></div><figcaption>smmm premaa istg</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="gallery-photo photo-filled"><img src="assets/photos/year-02-photo-10.jpeg" alt="Chai on the terrace in the early morning" /></div><figcaption>early morning chai and terracee</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="gallery-photo photo-filled"><img src="assets/photos/year-02-photo-11.jpeg" alt="Making Tang together" /></div><figcaption>Tang taagu bete</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="gallery-photo photo-filled"><img src="assets/photos/year-02-photo-12.jpeg" alt="Christmas celebrations at the basketball court" /></div><figcaption>christmas celebs in basketball court with marfa dance lmao</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="gallery-photo photo-filled"><img src="assets/photos/year-02-photo-13.jpg" alt="Tithi birthday photoshoot" /></div><figcaption>my tithi budday photoshoot</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="gallery-photo photo-filled"><img src="assets/photos/year-02-photo-14.jpeg" alt="Birthday terrace dance" /></div><figcaption>my actual budday terrace danceee</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="gallery-photo photo-filled"><img src="assets/photos/year-02-photo-15.jpeg" alt="Jeevana's birthday hairstylist moment" /></div><figcaption>Jeevana budday hairstylist</figcaption></figure></div></div>
